---
import StaticPageLayout from "../layouts/StaticPageLayout.astro";

export const prerender = true;

const pledgeSections = [
  {
    label: "01. AI & EXPERTISE",
    content: `Let's start with the big one: AI.

Yes, we use it. It's 2026, and any agency that says they don't is either lying to you or just plain inefficient. We're neither. We are not traditional, university-educated developers stuck in old ways. We are modern, agile, and relentlessly curious.

We use AI as a co-pilot, not as the chef. A prompt can't understand your business strategy, design a unique brand, or build a secure app. We use it to handle grunt work, which means we spend more time on what matters: strategy, custom design, and maintainable code.`,
  },
  {
    label: "02. PRICING",
    content: `Our pledge also covers your money.

The price we quote is the price you will pay. Period. If we've undercharged you or underestimated the work, that's on us. We'll take the hit and learn from it.

The only time that changes is if scope changes. If new requirements are added after agreement, we have an honest conversation and agree a fair adjustment.`,
  },
  {
    label: "03. PROCESS",
    content: `The same goes for our process.

We won't disappear. We provide 45 days of free snagging after launch. If you find a bug, we fix it. We'll also make minor tweaks for free within reason.

For bigger changes, we'll agree clearly whether it's a new feature or a quick fix. Full scope is agreed at the start so there are no surprises.`,
  },
  {
    label: "04. FIT",
    content: `Finally, our pledge is to be honest about fit.

We're looking for partners, and that requires the right match on both sides. We'll tell you if we don't think we're right for your project.

We don't build cheap quick-fix sites. We're a premium expert-led team for businesses serious about growth. If that's you, you'll get full transparency.`,
  },
];
---

<StaticPageLayout path="/pledge">
  <section class="bg-slate-900 px-4 py-24 text-white md:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <h1 class="font-mono text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-kaizen-cyan md:text-6xl">
        &gt; Our "No-BS" Pledge.
      </h1>
      <div class="mt-10 space-y-3 font-mono text-sm text-gray-400 md:text-base">
        <p>// This page exists because you deserve to know exactly how we work.</p>
        <p>// No marketing jargon. No black box. No surprise bills.</p>
        <p>// Transparent partnership. Clear expectations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-12 px-4 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="hidden lg:flex">
        <div class="sticky top-24 h-fit w-full rounded-2xl border border-kaizen-light bg-kaizen-light/50 p-8">
          <h2 class="text-5xl font-heading font-black text-kaizen-dark md:text-6xl">
            Our Terms
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base text-kaizen-text-dark/70">
            No hidden process, no hidden scope, no hidden costs.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-20">
        {
          pledgeSections.map((section) => (
            <article class="min-h-60">
              <h3 class="mb-8 text-4xl font-heading font-black text-kaizen-dark md:text-5xl">
                {section.label}
              </h3>
              <div class="space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-kaizen-text-dark/70">
                {section.content.split("\n\n").map((paragraph) => (
                  <p>{paragraph}</p>
                ))}
              </div>
            </article>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-kaizen-dark px-4 py-20 text-white md:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-4xl font-heading font-black md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
        Ready for a transparent partner?
      </h2>
      <p class="mb-12 text-xl leading-relaxed text-white/80">
        Now you know exactly how we work. Let's talk about your project.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-kaizen-cyan to-kaizen-lime px-8 py-3 font-heading font-bold text-kaizen-dark transition hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-kaizen-cyan/50"
      >
        Get in Touch
        <span aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</StaticPageLayout>
